<title>USA: Tiffany Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Tiffany Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.00		    $0.77</p>
<p> Shr diluted     1.00		     0.74</p>
<p> Net		 35,769		   25,473</p>
<p> Sales	     327,619		  280,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary35,852		   32,931</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted35,868		   34,816</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.67		    $1.22</p>
<p> Shr diluted     1.66		     1.19</p>
<p> Net		 58,439		   39,215</p>
<p> Sales	     922,108		  803,292</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary34,953		   32,234</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted35,706		   34,546</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Tiffany &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: Shares and net earnings per share data have been adjusted to reflect a two-for-one stock split in July 1996. The current Q4 includes a pretax $4.5 million for the sale of certain manufacturing assets. It also took $4.4 million charge in this quarter for planned closing and relocating a retail store. These charges were included in SG&amp;A excpenses.</p>
